      "content": "i get that historians disagree, but you said modern scholarship \"generally rejects\" the idea that he saved France. isnt that a bit of a stretch? if he hadn't signed the armistice and signed on with them, wouldn't france have just been a total occupied territory under direct german military rule with no sovereign government at all? it feels like saying he failed morally ignores the very real practical reality of what would've happened to the french people.",
